    {
      "source": "Status provides convenient constants for commonly used states like <a href=\"#UP\"><code>UP</code></a>,\n<a href=\"#DOWN\"><code>DOWN</code></a> or <a href=\"#OUT_OF_SERVICE\"><code>OUT_OF_SERVICE</code></a>.",
